        "value": "<h2>Description</h2><p>A massive monster that appeared from a faraway world. Made from clay and built like brick outhouses, golems are often found guarding bases.</p><h2>Defense</h2><p>AC 25, touch 9; flat-footed 25 (+16 natural, -1 size)</p><p>hp 101 (13d10+30)</p><p>Fort +4, Ref +4, Will +8</p><p>DR 10/adamantine; Immune construct traits, Earth; Resist Ice 10, Lightning 10, Water 5;</p><p>Weakness Wind</p><h2>Offense</h2><p>Speed 20 ft.</p><p>Melee 2 Slams +19 (2d8+7 plus slow)</p><p>Space 10 ft.; Reach 10 ft.</p><p>Special Attacks Earthquake, Haste, Rock Throw, Slow (DC 20 Fort save)</p><h2>Statistics</h2><p>Str 24, Dex 10, Con -, Int -, Wis 18, Cha 1</p><p>Base Atk +13; CMB +21; CMD 31 (36 vs trip)</p>"
